		(uuid "53fbe59e-52cd-428c-804f-84853e367e40")
	)
	(text "The LEDs, switches and decoders run from the Nucleo +5V. One column at a time is on: up to 60 x 5.7 mA = 341 mA.\nUSB-powered Nucleo: 300 mA for everything -> keep the lit pixels per column moderate, or power the Nucleo\nfrom E5V / VIN (JP3) for full-white images. The STP16 logic runs from +3V3 (MCU levels)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 241.3 0)
		(effects
