	(text "Scanning: one column at a time (31 columns, 1/31 duty). For column c: shift the row data into both chains\n(T_SDI / B_SDI), blank with nOE, latch with LE, select the column (band, decoder, A0-A2, EN), unblank.\nAverage LED current = I_LED / 31. The shield has no mounting holes: the LED field covers the whole board;\nit is held by the two 2x35 morpho sockets (solder the CN11/CN12 headers on the Nucleo first).\nSocket height must clear the Nucleo-144 Zio headers: use 8.5 mm sockets on 11 mm (or longer) pins."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
